        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;:&quot;@startuml\nstart\n:主动故障检测;\nif (检测到节点级GPU故障？) then (是)\n  :立即隔离故障节点;\n  :触发弹性扩缩容;\n  :在新节点恢复训练;\nelse (否)\n  :执行进程重启;\n\nendif\n stop\n@enduml\n&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;svg&quot;}" id="mJcnv9RB6uUCWiuuFbvc-8">
          <mxCell style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" parent="1" vertex="1">
